### LINEAR_COMPOSE   [Multivariate/vectors.ml statements requiring transport and generalization]
hash: e0b9f07b4aaa811debbf91e705f242a1
status: transport_required
statement: forall A B C:set, A <> Empty -> B <> Empty -> C <> Empty -> forall f:set -> set, (forall x :e R :^: idx A, f x :e R :^: idx B) -> forall g:set -> set, (forall x :e R :^: idx B, g x :e R :^: idx C) -> linear A B f /\ linear B C g -> linear A C (fun x:set => g (f x))

