### NORM_EQ_0   [Multivariate/vectors.ml statements requiring transport and generalization]
hash: 85262430d413f9519032f359ab28f502
status: transport_required
statement: forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall x :e R :^: idx A, vector_norm A x = 0 <-> x = vec A 0

### BASIS_INJ   [Multivariate/vectors.ml statements requiring transport and generalization]
hash: 52544faf0e2d9ff93a164e17870f8759
status: transport_required
statement: forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall i j :e omega, 1 <= i /\ (i <= dimindex N /\ (1 <= j /\ (j <= dimindex N /\ basis N i = basis N j))) -> i = j

