status: generalization_required
statement: forall A:set, forall P:set -> prop, (forall v :e A :^: idx 1, P v) <-> forall x :e A, P (vector A 1 (seq_cons x seq_nil))

### DOT_LMUL   [Multivariate/vectors.ml statements requiring transport and generalization]
